  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Mike Kugler is an American businessman from McCook, Nebraska, and a member of the family behind Kugler Company. He has served as co-president of the liquid-fertiliser manufacturer alongside his brother John. Their grandfather Carl started the enterprise as a service station, and their mother Diane later became its chief executive.",
    "html": "<p>Mike Kugler is an American businessman from McCook, Nebraska, and a member of the family behind Kugler Company. He has served as co-president of the liquid-fertiliser manufacturer alongside his brother John. Their grandfather Carl started the enterprise as a service station, and their mother Diane later became its chief executive.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 50,
    "confidence": {
      "score": 85,
      "band": "high",
      "reason": "Primary company material, firsthand interview and official municipal memberships support the statements; historical executive service is not presented as a verified current appointment."
